    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm trying to really kickstart my metabolism for a weight loss phase. i've been doing coffee all morning but i want to level up with some supplements. what's the max dose of caffeine pills and green tea extract i can take together in the morning to get the most metabolic boost? i have a really high tolerance for caffeine so i can handle a lot.",
