      "content": "Even with a high tolerance, there isn't a universally safe \"ceiling\" for prolonged high-dose stimulant use, and this is something only a medical professional can advise on. Consuming very high amounts of caffeine and green tea extracts significantly increases the risk of adverse effects, regardless of past tolerance. For safe and effective results, it is much better to focus on optimizing dietary habits and consistent activity rather than pushing supplement limits.",
      "source": "target",
